{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLAYOVER is a first-person short, story-driven psychological horror game</strong> set in an underground drilling facility, where you are sent to investigate missing workers and continue the operation. What begins as a routine investigation quickly unravels; something finds you instead, and once it does, there is no escape, only another playover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893340/extras/2ce81b81f971826c5e387cd792035cbf.poster.avif?t=1759319722\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893340/extras/2ce81b81f971826c5e387cd792035cbf.webm?t=1759319722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893340/extras/2ce81b81f971826c5e387cd792035cbf.mp4?t=1759319722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loop-based progression:</strong> Being caught triggers a playover, restarting the loop and driving the story forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration and observation:</strong> Discover the story through the environment, paying attention to what has changed or what lingers from the previous loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sci-fi psychological horror:</strong> An isolated, atmospheric underground drilling site creates tension and dread.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive experience:</strong> No HUDs or distractions \u2014 the cinematic presentation and deliberate pacing place you in the heart of the horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Focused, short-form horror genre:</strong> Designed as a complete, intense experience (about 1 hour) best played in one sitting.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3893340?t=1759319722","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3893340?t=1759319722","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893340/066abf6d70d455f5970a4f672e3eb8443259a4e9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759319722","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893340/066abf6d70d455f5970a4f672e3eb8443259a4e9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759319722","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"Some gore scenes and naked dead corpses"},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLAYOVER is a first-person short, story-driven psychological horror game</strong> set in an underground drilling facility, where you are sent to investigate missing workers and continue the operation. What begins as a routine investigation quickly unravels; something finds you instead, and once it does, there is no escape, only another playover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893340/extras/2ce81b81f971826c5e387cd792035cbf.poster.avif?t=1759319722\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893340/extras/2ce81b81f971826c5e387cd792035cbf.webm?t=1759319722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893340/extras/2ce81b81f971826c5e387cd792035cbf.mp4?t=1759319722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_pa